    <!-- Sample notes -->
    <string name="seed_1_title">Welcome to Notes</string>
    <string name="seed_1_tags">Getting started</string>
    <string name="seed_1_content">A paper-and-ink notebook with **Markdown** support.\n\n## You can\n- [x] Jot things down; they save automatically\n- [x] Add tags, colors and pins\n- [ ] Long-press a card for more actions\n- [ ] Tap the eye in the editor to preview the layout\n\n> Deleted notes go to the trash first and can be restored any time.\n\nAgentOS can use it too: tell the agent \"tag this note with ideas\" and the list refreshes right away.</string>
    <string name="seed_2_title">Markdown cheat sheet</string>
    <string name="seed_2_tags">Getting started,Tips</string>
    <string name="seed_2_content"># Heading one\n## Heading two\n\n**bold**, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~, `inline code`\n\n1. Ordered list\n2. Second item\n\u0020\u0020\u0020- A nested bullet\n\n```kotlin\nval answer = 42\n```\n\n[A link](https://example.com)\n\n---\n\nThe divider is above.</string>
    <string name="seed_3_title">This week</string>
    <string name="seed_3_tags">Work</string>
    <string name="seed_3_content">## This week\n- [x] Tidy up last week\'s meeting notes\n- [x] Reply to the partner email\n- [ ] Wednesday 3 pm: design review\n- [ ] Prepare Friday\'s talk\n- [ ] File expenses\n\n## Notes\nAlign the **dashboard** definitions before Friday.</string>
    <string name="seed_4_title">Reading notes: Deep Work</string>
    <string name="seed_4_tags">Reading</string>
    <string name="seed_4_content">> Focus is a skill that grows with practice.\n\n- Block out time that nobody can interrupt\n- Mute notifications, leave the phone in another room\n- End the day with a \"shutdown ritual\"\n\n**My takeaway**: start with 90 minutes a day.</string>
    <string name="seed_5_title">Weekend trip checklist</string>
    <string name="seed_5_tags">Life</string>
    <string name="seed_5_content">## Pack\n- [ ] Power bank\n- [ ] Umbrella\n- [x] Camera\n- [ ] Thermos\n\n## Route\n1. 9:00 leave\n2. 11:30 lunch\n3. 16:00 head back</string>
    <string name="seed_6_title">Prompt for the agent</string>
    <string name="seed_6_tags">Ideas,Work</string>
    <string name="seed_6_content">Turn the meeting recording into minutes in this format:\n\n```\n## Decisions\n## Action items (owner / due date)\n## Risks\n```\n\nKeep the tone neutral and every line under 30 words.</string>
    <string name="seed_7_title">Coffee log</string>
    <string name="seed_7_tags">Life</string>
    <string name="seed_7_content">**V60 · 15 g coffee / 240 g water**\n\n- Water 92°C\n- Bloom 30 s\n- Total time 2:30\n\nA bit sour; grind finer next time.</string>
